-- src:1227 | kê chỉ tiết những thiệt hại và/hoặc chỉ phí khắc phục.
-- src:1229 | Loại trừ bảo hiểm: Mất xe do bị trộm hoặc cướp tại các quốc gia đã thông báo cho Bảo hiểm
-- src:1230 | Tasco khi tham gia bảo hiểm (ngoài lãnh thổ Việt Nam).
@ref Rules, Chương VI, BS05 (src:1214-1230)
GIVEN `the cover` IS A `The physical damage cover`
      `the loss` IS A `A loss to the vehicle`
      `the facts` IS A `The facts for the additional clauses`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`BS05 — buys back the outside-Vietnam exclusion` `the cover` `the loss` `the facts` MEANS
        `the cover holds` `BS05 outside Vietnam` `the cover`
    AND `the facts`'s `the loss occurred in a country named on the certificate`
    AND `the facts`'s `the vehicle holds a valid circulation permit in that country`

@ref Rules, Chương VI, BS05(c) (src:1229-1230)
GIVEN `the loss` IS A `A loss to the vehicle`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`BS05 — theft abroad` `the loss` MEANS
        `the loss`'s `circumstances`'s `outside Vietnam`
    AND `the loss`'s `cause of the damage` EQUALS `theft or robbery of the whole vehicle`

§§ `BS06 — duty-free or temporarily imported vehicles`

-- (a) A vehicle temporarily imported then re-exported, a duty-free import, or a vehicle of a
-- foreign mission or foreigner exempted or temporarily imported. (b) A partial loss is paid on
-- the footing that the vehicle is insured at full value, its sum insured that of the same vehicle
-- with all taxes; a total loss is paid at the insured value before taxes, at the time of the
-- damage. (c) Repairs must be made in Vietnam.
-- src:1232 | Bảo hiểm vật chất đối với xe miễn thuế, tạm nhập, tái xuất - Mã số BS06/Tasco-XCG
