    `the facts`'s `temporarily imported for re-export, duty-free, or of a foreign mission`

@ref Rules, Chương VI, BS06(b) (src:1249-1251)
GIVEN `the facts` IS A `The facts for the additional clauses`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`BS06 — the total loss payable` `the facts` MEANS
    `the facts`'s `insured value before taxes`

