§§ `BS07 — hire car during repair`

-- (a) A passenger vehicle, not used for commercial transport, with fewer than 9 seats. (b) The
-- actual cost of hiring a car of the same or an equivalent kind while the vehicle is repaired
-- after a covered accident, 100% of it but no more than 500.000 dong a day, not counting days the
-- authorities hold the vehicle, at most 30 days per year of insurance. (c) Deductible: the hire
-- of 04 days counted from the day of the loss, days held by the authorities included.
-- src:1255 | Bảo hiểm chỉ phí thuê xe trong thời gian sửa chữa - Mã số BS07/Tasco-XCG
-- src:1257 | Điều kiện xe tham gia bảo hiểm: Xe cơ giới chở người không kinh doanh vận tải dưới 9 chỗ
-- src:1258 | ngồi.
-- src:1260 | Quyền lợi bảo hiểm:
-- src:1262 | Bảo hiểm Tasco sẽ thanh toán cho Chủ xe cơ giới chi phí thuê xe sử dụng trong thời gian sửa
-- src:1264 | chữa xe do tai nạn thuộc phạm vi trách nhiệm bảo hiểm, không tính thời gian xe bị cơ quan
-- src:1265 | chức năng giữ xe
-- src:1272 | Chỉ phí thuê xe được thanh toán: Bảo hiểm Tasco sẽ thanh toán 100% chỉ phí thực tế thuê xe
-- src:1273 | cùng chủng loại hoặc tương đương chiếc xe được bảo hiểm của chủ xe, nhưng không quá
-- src:1274 | 500.000 đồng/ngày trong thời gian xe sửa chữa.
-- src:1276 | Thời gian thanh toán chỉ phí thuê xe tối đa không quá 30 ngày/năm bảo hiểm.
-- src:1278 | Mức khấu trừ: Chi phí thuê xe 04 ngày tính từ ngày xảy ra tổn thất tính cả thời gian bị cơ quan
-- src:1279 | chức năng thu giữ.
@ref Rules, Chương VI, BS07(a) (src:1257-1258)
GIVEN `the vehicle` IS A `A vehicle`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`BS07 — the vehicle may hold the clause` `the vehicle` MEANS
        `the vehicle`'s `what it carries` EQUALS `people only`
    AND NOT `the vehicle`'s `used for business`
    AND `the vehicle`'s `number of seats` LESS THAN 9

-- A day is paid when the vehicle was under repair, not held by the authorities, and after the
-- four deductible days (day 1 is the day of the loss; fork F34). The first days paid count first
-- against the 30 of the insurance year.
@ref Rules, Chương VI, BS07(b)-(c) (src:1262-1279)
GIVEN `the days` IS A LIST OF `A day of hire`
      `days already paid this year of insurance` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`BS07 — the hire costs payable` `the days` `days already paid this year of insurance` MEANS
    sum (map `the payment for a day` (take `the days left this year` (filter `a paid day` `the days`)))
    WHERE
        `a paid day` d MEANS
                d's `the insured vehicle was under repair`
            AND NOT d's `the insured vehicle was held by the authorities`
            AND d's `day, counting the day of the loss as day 1` GREATER THAN 4
        `the payment for a day` d MEANS min (d's `the hire cost that day`) 500_000
        `the days left this year` MEANS max 0 (30 MINUS `days already paid this year of insurance`)

§§ `BS08 — temporary circulation`

-- (a) Losses while the vehicle circulates from the factory or customs warehouse to delivery,
-- or while registration, inspection and the registration fee are dealt with. (b) For new
-- vehicles with the factory quality slip, and imported ones with the import quality certificate
-- and customs clearance. (c) At most 30 days unless agreed otherwise in writing. (d) Excluded:
-- loss from the maker's or assembler's technical fault.
