`BS10 — no instructor or no auxiliary brake` `the facts` MEANS
        NOT `the facts`'s `an instructor was present at the accident`
    OR  NOT `the facts`'s `the auxiliary brake was fitted`

§§ `BS11 — additional equipment`

-- (a) Loss of equipment and tarpaulins fitted beyond the maker's: the first limb of Điều 15.8
-- bought back. (b) The actual reasonable cost of replacing it, or cash. The equipment must be
-- declared item by item, each with its own sum insured, must not change the vehicle's technical
-- or safety features, and must be lawful. Read as paying each item up to its own sum insured
-- (fork F37). The second limb of 15.8, loss to the vehicle CAUSED by added equipment, stays.
