@ref Rules, Chương VI, BS11 (src:1323-1345)
GIVEN `the cover` IS A `The physical damage cover`
      `the facts` IS A `The facts for the additional clauses`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`BS11 — buys back the added-equipment exclusion` `the cover` `the facts` MEANS
        `the cover holds` `BS11 additional equipment` `the cover`
    AND `the facts`'s `the added equipment was declared item by item with its sum insured`
    AND `the facts`'s `the added equipment is lawful and changes no technical or safety feature`

@ref Rules, Chương VI, BS11(b) (src:1328-1330, 1343-1344)
GIVEN `the facts` IS A `The facts for the additional clauses`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`BS11 — the payment for the lost item` `the facts` MEANS
    min (`the facts`'s `the cost of replacing the lost item of added equipment`)
        (`the facts`'s `the sum insured for the lost item of added equipment`)

§§ `BS12 — vandalism and riot`

-- (a) Damage from vandalism in protests or riots and public disorder: the riot limb of Điều 11.9
-- bought back (its "save as agreed otherwise in writing"). (b) Excluded: bombs, mines and
-- explosive devices. (c) The actual reasonable cost, or cash.
