@ref Rules, Chương VI, BS12 (src:1347-1351)
GIVEN `the cover` IS A `The physical damage cover`
      `the loss` IS A `A loss to the vehicle`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`BS12 — buys back the riot exclusion` `the cover` `the loss` MEANS
        `the cover holds` `BS12 vandalism and riot` `the cover`
    AND `the loss`'s `circumstances`'s `vandalism in a protest, riot or public disorder`
    AND NOT `the loss`'s `circumstances`'s `war or terrorism`
    AND NOT `the loss`'s `circumstances`'s `bombs, mines or explosive devices`

§§ `BS13 — special equipment`

-- (a) The vehicle must also hold physical damage cover. (b) Losses of the special equipment, and
-- losses to the vehicle caused by its own special equipment (Điều 15.9 bought back), save where
-- the special vehicle is not technically safe as the law requires, the operator lacks the proper
-- permit, or the operator intentionally broke the operating rules.
