GIVEN `the loss` IS A `A loss to the vehicle`
      `the facts` IS A `The facts for the additional clauses`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`BS13 — one of its exceptions applies` `the loss` `the facts` MEANS
        NOT `the facts`'s `the special vehicle is technically safe as the law requires`
    OR  `the loss`'s `circumstances`'s `special equipment operated without the required permit`
    OR  `the facts`'s `the operator intentionally broke the operating rules`

@ref Rules, Chương VI, BS13 (src:1357-1371)
GIVEN `the cover` IS A `The physical damage cover`
      `the loss` IS A `A loss to the vehicle`
      `the facts` IS A `The facts for the additional clauses`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`BS13 — buys back the special-equipment exclusion` `the cover` `the loss` `the facts` MEANS
        `the cover holds` `BS13 special equipment` `the cover`
    AND NOT `BS13 — one of its exceptions applies` `the loss` `the facts`

§§ `BS14 — goods of the vehicle owner`

-- (a) For goods vehicles, on the terms of "Quy tắc bảo hiểm tự nguyện xe ôtô của Bảo hiểm Tasco",
-- another document not in the sources (finding X20); the vehicle must also hold the goods
-- liability cover of Chương IV. (b) Damage to the goods carried caused by the driver, even where
-- the owner is the cargo owner; but not where the owner is the driver and also the cargo owner.
