@ref Rules, Chương VI, BS14(a) (src:1377-1381)
GIVEN `the vehicle` IS A `A vehicle`
      `holds the goods liability cover` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`BS14 — the vehicle may hold the clause` `the vehicle` `holds the goods liability cover` MEANS
        NOT (`the vehicle`'s `what it carries` EQUALS `people only`)
    AND `holds the goods liability cover`

@ref Rules, Chương VI, BS14(b) (src:1383-1388)
GIVEN `the driver caused the damage to the goods` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the owner is the cargo owner` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the owner was the driver` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`BS14 — the damage to the goods is covered` `the driver caused the damage to the goods` `the owner is the cargo owner` `the owner was the driver` MEANS
        `the driver caused the damage to the goods`
    AND NOT (`the owner is the cargo owner` AND `the owner was the driver`)

§§ `BS15 — the battery of an electric car`

-- (a) An electric car whose period of use is under 6 years ("dưới 6 năm", fewer than 72 months).
-- (b) The actual reasonable cost of replacing or repairing the main battery after a loss within
-- the cover. (c) Excluded: a battery not made or fitted by the maker; loss to the battery alone,
-- not with other parts by the same cause in the same accident; technical fault, wear, or loss of
-- charging capacity; a cause outside the cover; the other exclusions of the rules.
-- (d) Deductible: 10% of the compensation, at least 3.000.000 dong per loss.
-- The base cover already pays the battery (the table of Điều 18.1.2(b) has a column for it); how
-- the clause combines with Chương II is not said, and this encoding computes the clause on its
-- own: the battery's reasonable cost as Điều 18.1.2 measures it, less this deductible (fork F35;
-- finding X24 compares the two).
-- src:1390 | Bảo hiểm pin xe điện - Mã số BS15/Tasco-XCG
-- src:1391 | Đối tượng áp dụng: Xe ô tô điện thời gian sử dụng dưới 6 năm.
-- src:1393 | Quyền lợi bảo hiểm: Bảo hiểm Tasco sẽ thanh toán chỉ phí thực tế, hợp lý để thay thế hoặc sửa
